WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sn.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.960
Vhidhiyo iyi inotsanangura nzira yekugadzirira mwana naamai, kana kutarisira, vasati vaita homwe-tsvuku

2
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.840
Reflex bvunzo mune vese vachangozvarwa uye vana vakura.

3
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.720
Mwana anofanira kuchengetwa akachengeteka, asi zvakanaka,

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:20.524
pamwe pamakumbo pamusoro pefudzi, kana mwana akarara nemanhede.

5
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:23.840
Zvakakosha kuti vanzwe vakachengeteka.

6
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.640
Vacheche vacheche vanogona kusazororera uye vangada kuputirwa.

7
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:35.600
Kuongorora nguva pfupi mushure mekudya kunogona kubatsira sezvo vachange vakasununguka uye nehope shoma.

8
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.800
Vana vedu vese vanogona kugadzikana nekutamba nechitoyi kwenguva pfupi.

9
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.560
Taura nezwi rine hushamwari uye edza kudzika kusvika padanho remeso avo.

10
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:52.080
Tsanangura zvauchaita uye uwane pfungwa usati watanga.

11
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:57.493
Kutanga, bvunza amai kana kutarisira kana vasina kukanganisa kwavo

12
00:00:57.493 --> 00:00:59.040
ziso kana kuona kwemwana

13
00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.880
uye kwenguva yakareba sei vasina dambudziko.

14
00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.720
Zvadaro, tarisa chiso nemaziso zvomwana.

15
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.336
Zvibvunze mimwe mibvunzo.

16
00:01:06.336 --> 00:01:11.184
Mwana anoita seane kurwadziwa muziso rimwe chete here?

17
00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:12.800
Maziso akavhurika here

18
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.488
kana kuti vari kudzivhara zvakasimba?

19
00:01:15.488 --> 00:01:18.560
Pane kudiridza here kana kubuda mumaziso?

20
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.440
Maziso acho akaenzana here?

21
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.000
Maziso akazvimba here?

22
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.040
Iye zvino, funga kuti mwana ari kuona sei.

23
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:31.040
Fambisa chiso chako zvishoma nezvishoma kubva kune rumwe rutivi kuenda kune rumwe, kutarisa maziso.

24
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.880
Ita imwe nyemwerero yakanyarara.

25
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.040
Mwana anotevera kufamba kwechiso chako here?

26
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.840
Kana kupindura kunyemwerera kwako kwakanyarara?

27
00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.040
Zvibvunzezve mimwe mibvunzo.

28
00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.440
Maziso ose ari maviri anofamba zvakasununguka uye pamwe chete here?

29
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:51.040
Maziso akatwasuka here, kana kuti rimwe ziso riri kutendeukira mukati kana kunze?

30
00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.670
Maziso anodonha here?

31
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.866
Iwe unogona zvakare kushandisa tochi pane arclights uye mifananidzo ye

32
00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:01.350
mubhedha kuti uwane pfungwa

33
00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.590
uye kuongorora kunaka kwechiratidzo.

34
00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:08.230
Fambisa rutivi rwakanangwa kuenda kumusoro uye pasi.

35
00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.470
Tarisa uone kana mwana ari kugadzirisa uye kutevera zvinangwa.

36
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:17.790
Kana vasvika vonongedza nemazvo pa

37
00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:22.110
chinangwa, kazhinji ziso rimwe chete harigoni kuona zvakanaka.

38
00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:26.830
Iwe kana amai munogona kuvhara ziso rimwe, ipapo rimwe.

39
00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.784
Fambisa chinangwa uye enzanisa maitiro emwana kana achishandisa maziso ese,

40
00:02:32.784 --> 00:02:34.910
ipapo mumwe panguva.

41
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:40.323
Kana mwana asingadi kuti ziso rimwe chete rakavharwa, rinoratidza kuti rakafukunurwa

42
00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:41.870
ziso harioni

43
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.870
zvakanaka.

44
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:48.602
Kana iwe uchifunga kuti unogona kuona chimwe chinhu chakaipa neziso rekunze, tarisa zvakanyanya

45
00:02:48.602 --> 00:02:49.830
pedyo kushandisa

46
00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.870
loop kupera kwechiedza.

47
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:58.310
Batidza mwenje uye uswedere pedyo nekutenderedza 6 cm.

48
00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:04.390
Ungangoda kushandisa chigunwe chako kuvhura zvinyoro nyoro zviziso.

49
00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:07.390
Zvibvunze mimwe mibvunzo.

50
00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:12.470
Ko chikamu chichena cheziso chatove pink?

51
00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:19.670
Mwana uyu kana cornea grey kana chena ndiyo pupil round.

52
00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.190
Unogona kuona chero miviri yekunze?

53
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.550
Iye zvino wagadzirira kuita reflex bvunzo.
